I was in the process of dying in the most unfair possible way (stepped into
a room; was struck by a sleep blast from an orange dragon; flesh golem came
up behind me and struck me 20 times without my waking up) when my connection 
crashed. Upon reestablishing the link and restarting nethack, I was told:

restoring save file .. you were not healthy enough to survive restoration...

What character do you want to play [etc] ?


This made sense; I was just on the point of dying. I chose a Valkyrie as my
new character, and the game started up normally, when I was attacked by a 
dwarf. A dwarf on level 1, I thought? Then I noticed that I was on dungeon 
level 18 (eighteen). Well, my first level character fought ferociously, 
dispatching the dwarf, a lizard, and a cockatrice, but the water elemental
was too much for me. 

Reincarnation's not all it's cracked up to be, I suppose...


